      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The feeling that your presence is a negative equation is a symptom of deep despair, not reality. Your life has intrinsic value, and the feeling that you are a burden is a painful distortion caused by emotional pain. Please understand that the relief you imagine for them is a projection of your own suffering, not a guarantee of their feelings. Right now, the most important thing is to keep yourself safe; please contact the National Suicide Prevention Lifeline at 988.",
